@startuml
title Asset Flow State Machine
left to right direction
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

state "ON THE MOVE" as OnMove
state "IN PLACE" as InPlace
state "PENDING APPROVAL" as Pending
state "UNAUTHORIZED" as Unauthorized

[*] --> OnMove : asset registered
OnMove --> InPlace : detected at expected room
InPlace --> Pending : movement requested
Pending --> InPlace : request rejected or cancelled
Pending --> OnMove : request approved
InPlace --> Unauthorized : detected at unexpected room
OnMove --> Unauthorized : detected at wrong destination
Unauthorized --> InPlace : returned to assigned room

note bottom of Pending
Movement-request status is modeled
separately from asset flow status.
end note
@enduml
